# Everything the image build does not need. Keeping the context small also keeps
# a real config.yaml, which holds the switch password in clear text, out of the
# build cache and out of any intermediate layer.
#
# Note: config.yaml.example is deliberately NOT excluded, the image ships it.
.git
.github
.gitignore
.golangci.yml
.dockerignore
Dockerfile
config.yaml
*.md
cheap-switch-exporter
*.test
*.out
